# Build output. The module is rebuilt from src/module.cpp; the package is
# rebuilt from PackageDefinitions by fspackagetool. Nothing here is source.
build/
PackagesMetadata/
PackageSources/Modules/
_PackageInt/

# `Packages/` is the exception, and is committed.
#
# It is build output like the rest, but it is the only build output that can
# never be reproduced by anything but a maintainer: the SDK has no unattended
# install and `fspackagetool` drives the game executable, so no hosted runner
# can produce it. The app's install flow copies this folder into somebody's
# Community folder, and `electron-builder.yml` ships it through
# `extraResources` — a checkout without it builds an app that cannot install
# the module at all.
#
# ~300 KB, three files. Rebuilt by `npm run link:build`, which is also what
# updates it here.

# Reader transcripts. Evidence, but session-local — promote one to
# src/main/sim/fixtures/ if it is worth keeping.
transcripts/
